295	 * near river (real ribbon) and the far tunnel's river met at the sliding seam with a hard straight line — the near design
296	 * ended there and the far river's own baked approved water (proj05_F.png) began, a different picture of the water. Over
297	 * a band before the seam the ribbon now cross-fades into exactly what the far river shows (the same F texture, the same
298	 * virtual depth / lateral mapping and post-chain inverse), so the two surfaces show the same water where they meet: the
299	 * line dissolves into a soft transition. Uniforms written every frame by src/world/match05far.ts (c0 / axis T / right Rt
300	 * of the far tunnel, seam depth zs, band length, half chord, live); locked view + the 06 fold: live = 0, nothing changes.
301	 */
