324	 * `&m05wall=1` (Screen 05 round 9, needs m05far; src/vfx/proj05Tunnel.ts withProj05Wall): CRISP PURPLE METAL WALLS while
325	 * swimming. The walls wear the approved picture camera-projected per bay (wall05e.png atlas); swimming brings them 2–6×
